  "details": "Infinite \"Reconnecting\" loop when loading Home World\n\n Every time I launch VRChat via Steam, the game starts normally and SteamVR initializes without issues. However, once the loading screen finishes and the game attempts to load my default Home world, I receive a \"Your connection to VRChat has expired\" error.\n\nAfter this message appears, the game enters an infinite \"Reconnecting\" loop and never manages to enter the world.\n\nThe only way I can currently access the game is by bypasssing the Home world: I have to go to the VRChat website, select a different world, and click \"Launch\" from the browser. This is the only method that allows me to get past the loading screen.\n\nSystem Information:\n\nPlatform: Steam / SteamVR\n\nConnection type: Ethernet",
